1. **An adaptive learning system comprising:**  
   a presentation unit configured to present learning content comprising a plurality of content elements to a user;  
   a bioinformation acquisition unit configured to obtain bioinformation of the user during presentation of the respective content elements;  
   an understanding-level calculation unit configured to calculate, based at least in part on the obtained bioinformation, an understanding level of the user for each of the content elements;  
   a non-understanding detection unit configured to identify a content element for which the calculated understanding level satisfies a non-understanding criterion;  
   an understanding-type determination unit configured to determine, for the identified content element, an understanding type indicative of a manner or cause of the user’s non-understanding; and  
   an adaptive information selection unit configured to select, according to the determined understanding type, supplemental or modified information suitable for improving understanding of the identified content element,  
   wherein the presentation unit is further configured to present the selected information to the user.
